{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Cowardly Pig is a cute and spooky incremental game about facing your fears\u2014one squish at a time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006710/extras/6aab62ade8caea4ec2b0aa98506d8a74.poster.avif?t=1758217796\" width=600 height=297 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006710/extras/6aab62ade8caea4ec2b0aa98506d8a74.webm?t=1758217796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a scaredy pig with a severe fear of spiders and the dark.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006710/extras/e7c9a8492b070168c32c5d12661d8dc0.poster.avif?t=1758217796\" width=600 height=283 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006710/extras/e7c9a8492b070168c32c5d12661d8dc0.webm?t=1758217796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Squash creepy-crawlies to earn money and collect resources to upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006710/extras/75a6a581ea3559b8101af8b8881dcbc6.poster.avif?t=1758217796\" width=600 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006710/extras/75a6a581ea3559b8101af8b8881dcbc6.webm?t=1758217796\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and upgrade the skill tree to build up your courage and strengthen your hammer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features